== Effects ==
* {{e|Troll Bomb}}s turn into {{e|Bomb}} pickups before they explode.
** {{e|Mega Troll Bomb}}s turn into {{e|Double Bomb}}s.
** {{E|Golden Troll Bomb}}s turn into {{e|Golden Bomb}}s.
** Giga bombs (thrown by {{e|Bombgagger|n}}s and {{E|Ultra War|n}}) turn into their respective {{E|Giga Bomb}} pickups.

== Strategy ==
* {{Dlc|r}} Bombing a {{M|Bomb Bum}} while possessing this trinket will convert the {{e|Troll Bomb}}s he spawns into regular {{e|Bomb}}s. This process can be repeated indefinitely for unlimited {{e|Bomb}} pickups.
** These {{e|Bomb}} pickups can be rerolled with the {{I|D20}}.
* Large amounts of {{e|Bomb}} pickups can be farmed if used against {{E|Little Horn}}, {{E|War}}, {{E|Pride}}, or other {{e|Troll Bomb}} spawning enemies or items like {{i|Anarchist Cookbook}} or {{i|Curse of the Tower}}.

== Notes ==
* The disarming effects of the {{e|Troll Bomb}}s will apply to {{E|Chub}} when she swallows it, as the {{e|Bomb}} pickups will come out shortly after, not damaging her.
* Does not affect {{E|Wrath}}'s Bombs.
** {{dlc|a+}} {{E|Super Wrath}}'s Bombs turn into their respective pickups.
* Does not affect {{E|Big Horn}}'s hot Bombs.
* Does not affect bombs from the Explosive Diarrhea [[pill]].
* {{Dlc|r}} Does not affect {{E|Hornfel|n}}'s Bombs.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|BOGO Bombs}}: Turns a Troll Bomb into a {{e|Double Bomb}}.
* {{c|Tainted ???}}: Bombs are converted into poop pickups.
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Reduces the size of enemy explosions. Having both reduces the size of enemy explosions even more.

